The numbers is a list of 1, 3, 5, 4, and 7.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The longest is 1.
The run is 1.
For every spot from 1 to last.
If item spot of numbers is more than item (spot minus 1) of numbers, add 1 to run, otherwise set run to 1.
If run is more than longest, set longest to run.

Show longest.
